{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/106592-newbie-question-about-cover","id":106592,"title":"Newbie Question About Cover","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-05T16:12:00-07:00","id":106592,"title":"Newbie Question About Cover","content":"Hello, I'm a newbie about this new Demons The Descent and i have a question about Covers: I remember that in the old Demons' edition an Unchained needs to stole a human corpse to hide himself from his foes. But in this new game it's different? Here the Unchainded trasforms itselfs into a human and shapes a new reality around himself and maybe he could become the soon of a couple without childrens. It's right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-05T20:58:57-07:00","id":106698,"title":"","content":"It's similar on the surface to the previous edition, but a different thing is happening. In Fallen you're entering an 'empty' human body and your demon-self kinda merges with the dead human-self, grounding your power with that specific human's memories and emotions and things. In Descent, you initially had a new identity created for you by the God-Machine: like there's a new guy at the office that no one thinks twice about, or a childless couple has suddenly always had a son. Your Cover didn't exist before. Once you fall and become Unchained, you can either take other people's souls entirely and completely step into their pre-existing &quot;real&quot; lives, or you can take individual parts of other people's lives (their job, their pet, the fact that they lived in a certain house until last year) and 'attach' them to you, reprogramming reality so those things happened to your Cover instead.<br /> <br /> And in both Descent and Fallen, you still have your full-on supernatural demon form that you can transform into.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-06T01:33:08-07:00","id":106787,"title":"","content":"I see... and when a Demon turns back to his true Demon Form, the Cover is gone forever?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-06T05:04:28-07:00","id":106838,"title":"","content":"No, the Cover only vanishes if you consciously choose to destroy it. Demons can actually have multiple Covers, and swap between them, as well as their native Demon Form, at will. <br /> <br /> Its like flipping a switch between modes: Mr Gold the pawnbroker on one setting, Ms Radiant the high society socialite on another, and the Shining Angel of Heresy on a third. You can switch between the different modes quite easily. <br /> <br /> The only catch is that you have to occasionally live all those lives.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}